select the best answer.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm that the tool's output specifies patient left vs. right and the anatomical lobe/region.\",\n    \"Verify that at least two independent tools agree on the laterality and location of the finding.\"\n  ]\n}"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":467,"total_tokens":836,"completion_tokens":369,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":467},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":369}}}